<title>BOTSWANA: Kgola Ya Sechaba yr shr, div rises.</title>
<headline>Kgola Ya Sechaba yr shr, div rises.</headline>
<dateline>GABORONE 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr ended Sept 30 vs 15 months to Sept 30 1995</p>
<p>			(million pula unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (thebe)		 135     vs     130</p>
<p>Div 9.0 thebe making total</p>
<p> for year		     16.0     vs   14.5</p>
<p>    Gross attrib income     5.92    vs    5.86</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		     5.27    vs    4.73</p>
<p>    Tax			   0.29    vs    0.23</p>
<p>    Gross income		5.72    vs    5.54</p>
<p>    Income from assoc	 0.93    vs    1.36</p>
<p>Div payable: Jan 23</p>
<p>On register: Jan 10</p>
<p>Full name: Kgolo Ya Sechaba Limited.</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said options which might enhance shareholder wealth were being reviewed as they aware of concerns about the discount between the net asset value and market value of the shares.</p>
<p>The 15-month reporting period stems from Kgola Ya Sechaba changing its year end in late 1995.</p>
<p>-- Gaborone newsroom +267 347182</p>
